# Cursor rules — lens-studio (Spectacles client)

You are working on the **Spectacles Lens Studio** client for dimos-ar. Python lives in
`../dimos-ar/`. The cross-repo contract is `../dimos-ar/docs/PROTOCOL.md`.

Before Lens work, read:

- `../dimos-ar/docs/PROTOCOL.md` — WebSocket message schema (implement in `Protocol.ts`)
- `../dimos-ar/docs/LENS_DEVELOPMENT.md` — UI patterns, Reachy + Agent Center references, MCP
- `../dimos-ar/clients/web/src/protocol.ts` — reference TypeScript types for the protocol

## Non-negotiable facts

- This Lens speaks JSON WebSocket to `ARBridge` on the Mac — it does NOT embed DimOS or Python.
- **Architecture** follows [spectacles-reachy-mini](https://github.com/V4C38/spectacles-reachy-mini):
  `DimosManager` (facade) → `SetupWizard` / `UIManager` / `BridgeClient` /
  `AlignmentController`. Setup wizard **auto-starts on lens launch** (Reachy UX).
- **UI**: outer panel frames are scene-placed (`@input wizardFrame`, `@input mainUIFrame`);
  inner content (text, buttons, inputs) is **runtime-instantiated** via
  `UI/Shared/UIBuilders.ts` (Agent Center pattern). See `LENS_DEVELOPMENT.md`.
- **Marker detection** runs only during wizard Step 1 (Calibrate). `AlignmentController`
  `start()` / `stop()` gates MarkerTracking; bridge gates AprilTag detection on `align_start` /
  `align_stop`.
- Use generic protocol names on the wire — not Spectacles-only naming.
- When the protocol changes, update `Protocol.ts` here AND `../dimos-ar/dimos_ar/protocol.py`
  + `../dimos-ar/docs/PROTOCOL.md` + `../dimos-ar/clients/web/src/protocol.ts`.

## Script layout

```text
Assets/Scripts/
├── DimosManager.ts
├── SetupWizard.ts
├── UIManager.ts
├── Network/BridgeClient.ts, Protocol.ts
├── Alignment/AlignmentController.ts
├── Rendering/LidarPointCloud.ts, RobotMarker.ts
└── UI/Shared/UIBuilders.ts, UIConstants.ts, UIAnimations.ts, DirtyComponent.ts
```

## Lens Studio MCP

Global MCP config only: `~/.cursor/mcp.json` (see `../dimos-ar/docs/LENS_DEVELOPMENT.md`).
Do not add a project-level `.cursor/mcp.json` here.
Lens Studio must be open with MCP server running.

## Build discipline

- M1: WebSocket, setup wizard, AprilTag alignment, lidar/pose render.
- Verify bridge with `../dimos-ar` replay + `clients/web/` before device deploy.
- Keep `Cache/` out of git.

## Packages

Expect SpectaclesInteractionKit (SIK) and SpectaclesUIKit as `.lspkg` under
`Packages/`. Pin versions; document upgrades.
